sc(rows[i].day)}: ${esc(chartValue(p.value))}</title></circle>`).join('')}</svg><div class=\"chart-points\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Detalle por fecha\">${rows.map((r,i)=>`<button class=\"${i===homeSelected?'active':''}\" data-chart-point=\"${i}\" aria-pressed=\"${i===homeSelected}\" aria-label=\"Ver ${esc(r.day)}\">${r.day.slice(8)}/${r.day.slice(5,7)}</button>`).join('')}</div><div id=\"chart-detail\" class=\"chart-detail\" role=\"status\">${selected?`${esc(selected.day)} · ${esc(chartMetricNames[homeMetric])}: <b>${esc(chartValue(selected.report[homeMetric]))}</b>`:''}</div><details class=\"chart-table\"><summary>Ver tabla de datos y definiciones</summary><p class=\"cv-help\">Importe de pedidos incluye registros posteriormente cancelados; no es dinero cobrado. Ingresos se reconocen al despachar, netos de créditos.</p><div class=\"cv-table\"><table class=\"mini-table\"><thead><tr><th>Fecha</th><th>Pedidos</th><th>Importe registrado</th><th>Ingresos netos</th></tr></thead><tbody>${rows.map(r=>`<tr><td>${r.day}</td><td>${r.report.registeredOrders}</td><td>${money(r.report.registeredCents)}</td><td>${money(r.report.revenueCents)}</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div></details></article>`;}\nfunction topChart(r){const products=Object.entries(r.topProducts).sort((a,b)=>b[1]-a[1]),max=Math.max(1,...products.map(([,q])=>q));return `<article class=\"card\"><div class=\"panel-head\"><div><h3>Productos más despachados</h3><p>Bolsas brutas del período · no resta devoluciones</p></div></div><div class=\"product-ranking\">${products.map(([name,qty],i)=>`<button class=\"rank-item\" data-ranking=\"${i}\"><span>${esc(name)}<b>${qty} bolsa(s)</b></span><i><em style=\"width:${qty/max*100}%\"></em></i></button>`).join('')||'<p class=\"empty-state\">Todavía no hay despachos en este período.</p>'}</div><p id=\"ranking-detail\" class=\"cv-help\">Toca un producto para consultar sus existencias.</p></article>`;}\nfunction expensesChart(r){const rows=CVVisual.expenseRows(r),max=M